  If M2 sits at ~0% while M1 is positive and grows with the product of the hazards, the shipped
  composition has a systematic upward bias that the exact form removes, and the bias is the
  p_s*p_d term rather than grid discretisation. The frailty row is expected to break both,
  because there the independent-latent-times assumption the product survival needs is false.
